# Generated and data artefacts: never render a textual diff.
#
# local-ai-knowledge.json is 4.6 MB on essentially ONE line (it is a minified
# retrieval index). `git diff local-ai-knowledge.json` therefore prints
# megabytes of BM25 idf tables into whatever is reading stdout — on
# 2026-09-20 that froze an agent session mid-command and the operator had to
# kill it. `-diff` makes git say "Binary files … differ" instead, which is the
# only honest summary of a change to a machine-generated blob.
#
# To actually inspect one of these, use the bounded reader:
#   python3 scripts/safe-inspect.py <file>          # stats + shape
#   python3 scripts/safe-inspect.py --diff <file>   # bounded diff --stat + JSON key deltas
#
# linguist-generated keeps them collapsed in GitHub PR review for the same
# reason: nobody reads 11,000 lines of generated index to review a change.
local-ai-knowledge.json  -diff linguist-generated
tools-index.json         -diff linguist-generated
api/tools.json           -diff linguist-generated
related.json             -diff linguist-generated
cards/cards.json         -diff linguist-generated
cards/cards-lite.json    -diff linguist-generated

# Derived HTML catalogues (regenerated by scripts/, verified with --check).
# A one-tool change rewrites thousands of lines; the diff is noise and, for
# the 800 KB ones, a terminal-full of it.
tools-index.html         -diff linguist-generated
embed.html               -diff linguist-generated
tools.html               -diff linguist-generated
sitemap.html             -diff linguist-generated
sitemap.xml              -diff linguist-generated
llms-full.txt            -diff linguist-generated
categories/*.html        -diff linguist-generated
api/tools/*.json         -diff linguist-generated

# Normalise line endings for text so a CRLF editor cannot produce a
# whole-file diff of a 400 KB generated page.
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf

# Genuinely binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.woff2 binary
